Z||000007||fierodave||10-17-2000||11:23 AM||||just so you all know ~~~~~~~~ <P>I am going to sell this car!  <P>I think it's ugly as hell! but that's just my opionion!<P>NO Imsa Wing came with it, but I do have the over the roof set of scoops that may look good with this car!<P>It's going in the shop this week to start the final assembly of the kit and to get it to the stage of urathane primer before final sanding before paint!  <P>I will be  accepting offers once in primer and the glass work is done! <BR>and I get a chance to go through the car and get a better picture of it's overall condition.<P>I just got off the phone with my bodyman and he will paint this car in any stock single color (no illusion's ) what ever you find in a paint book for $1,400.00 which includes all the materials, wet sanding & buffing and final glazeing!  <BR>Any Stripes, Graphic's, or multi colorerd skems you need to contact him for addtionial price He has a great restoration shop, and his work is top notch, AND he loves to do fiberglass work!<P>I do know the kit sold for $3,500 new and it's a fitted deal now!  and I would venture to guess the car under it is worth around $1,000.00<BR>(sell for less)<P>the car was built on a loaded 85 GT<BR>it has 105,000 on it with a new clutch, pressure plate & throwout bearing, slave and master. Has the sunroof, clean interior, some sort of dash kit, new heads!  it runs and drives too!  the pads & rotors may need to be replaced & turned we will see on that once it's driven a bit they may just need turned to clean them up!<BR>I will check on the options to make sure there all working!  <P>I have an extra factory wing and that set off scoops we could include in whatever type of package deal we set up!<P>Hey  shoot a price at me   lol  you never know  lol  remember the pain meds make me goofy!!!!<P>I am looking for a real nice low mile 86-88 5-speed GT  :~) <P>If someone has an extra one that wanted an IMSA more than there GT!!!<BR>maybe we could work it out!<P><BR>So if anyone has any interesting trades~~~ plus cash start making the offers!  I would even think about not getting any of the glass work done for a bit better price on it for you if your handy with glass  I will have more pic's of this car comming in the next few days.  keep watching for updates on my site!<BR>thanks for the space <BR>FD<P>[This message has been edited by fierodave (edited 10-17-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by fierodave (edited 10-17-2000).]||||reg||1
